{"root":"tawan","ipa":"/tawan/","core":"指被俘虏的人，或者在战争、冲突中被对方抓获的人。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","工作"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/tawan/","zh":"俘虏，被抓获的人","phrases":[{"t":"tawan perang","zh":"战俘"},{"t":"menjadi tawan","zh":"成为俘虏"},{"t":"mengambil tawan","zh":"抓获俘虏"}],"examples":[{"t":"Banyak tentara menjadi tawan setelah pertempuran itu.","zh":"那场战斗后，许多士兵成了俘虏。"},{"t":"Mereka memperlakukan tawan dengan manusiawi.","zh":"他们人道地对待俘虏。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"tawan","ipa":"/tawan/","zh":"俘虏","phrase":{"t":"tawan musuh","zh":"敌方俘虏"},"example":{"t":"Dia adalah tawan yang selamat.","zh":"他是幸存的俘虏。"}},{"w":"menawan","ipa":"/mənawan/","zh":"俘虏，抓获；迷人的，动人的","phrase":{"t":"pemandangan yang menawan","zh":"迷人的景色"},"example":{"t":"Senyumannya sangat menawan.","zh":"她的笑容非常迷人。"}},{"w":"tawanan","ipa":"/tawanan/","zh":"俘虏，囚犯","phrase":{"t":"tawanan politik","zh":"政治犯"},"example":{"t":"Tawanan itu dibebaskan setelah negosiasi.","zh":"经过谈判后，那名囚犯被释放了。"}},{"w":"menawan hati","ipa":"/mənawan hati/","zh":"吸引，迷住","phrase":{"t":"menawan hati penonton","zh":"吸引观众"},"example":{"t":"Pertunjukan itu menawan hati semua orang.","zh":"那场表演迷住了所有人。"}}],"derSlugs":["tawan","menawan","tawanan","menawan hati"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-27T16:43:51.496Z","src":"base"}